\viewkind4\uc1\pard\lang1033\f1\fs28\b O'NEST GURUKUL - SCHOOL IMAGE & MEDIA CONSENT LETTER\b0\fs24\par
\par
\b Date:\b0  ________________________\par
\b Registered School Name:\b0  O'Nest Gurukul\par
\b Campus Address:\b0  Wadekar Wadi, Ambeshet Road, Abhyudhya Nagar, Chinchkhari, Ratnagiri, Maharashtra - 415639\par
\b Website Domain:\b0  onestgurukul.in\par
\par
\pard\sb100\sa100\f1\fs22
To Whom It May Concern,\par
\par
This formal letter serves as an authorization and consent agreement between O'Nest Gurukul (the "School") and the Website Developer (the "Developer") regarding the publication and technical management of image and media assets on the school's official website (onestgurukul.in).\par
\par
\b 1. Scope of Supplied Media Assets\b0\par
The School authorizes the Developer to utilize the following categories of media files supplied directly by the School administration:\par
- School logos, branding marks, and vector drawings.\par
- Photographs and video recordings of school events, sports activities, and academic classes.\par
- Campus landscaping, smart classrooms, laboratories, and library facilities photography.\par
- Professional portraits of staff members, teachers, and school leadership.\par
- Photographs of students participating in campus activities, subject to prior parental release clearances obtained by the School.\par
\par
\b 2. Warranty of Rights and Clearances\b0\par
The School warrants and confirms that it holds the legal copyrights, licenses, or appropriate parental permissions for all media assets provided to the Developer. The School agrees that it shall NOT provide any photographs, videos, or student media files to the Developer for publication where the appropriate parental release or legal consent has not been obtained.\par
\par
\b 3. Authorization for Technical Modifications\b0\par
The School hereby authorizes the Developer to perform necessary technical modifications on the supplied media assets solely for the development, optimization, and smooth operations of the school website. Authorized modifications include:\par
- Technical cropping, resizing, formatting, and scaling for responsive page display.\par
- Compressing and converting assets to modern web formats (such as WebP or AVIF) to improve mobile loading speeds.\par
- Displaying and publishing the modified media on onestgurukul.in.\par
\par
\b 4. Limitation of Developer Liability\b0\par
The Developer shall act strictly as a technical publisher. The Developer is not responsible for verifying parent release files, checking permissions logs, or validating copyright ownership of the images supplied by the School. The School retains all liabilities regarding the legal compliance of the content, announcements, and media assets supplied by the School.\par
\par
\b 5. Signatures and Approvals\b0\par
By signing below, both parties confirm agreement with these terms.\par
\par
